#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.replace.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.replace"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:1
msgid "Replace each occurrence of pattern/regex in the Series/Index."
msgstr "替换 Series/Index 中模式/正则表达式的每次出现。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:3
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :meth:`str.replace` or :func:`re.sub`, depending on the "
"regex value."
msgstr "等价于 :meth:`str.replace` 或 :func:`re.sub`，取决于 regex 值。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:6
msgid ""
"String can be a character sequence or regular expression. Dictionary "
"contains <key : value> pairs of strings to be replaced along with the "
"updated value."
msgstr "字符串可以是字符序列或正则表达式。字典包含要替换的字符串及其更新值的<键:值>对。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:10
msgid ""
"Replacement string or a callable. The callable is passed the regex match "
"object and must return a replacement string to be used. Must have a value"
" of None if `pat` is a dict See :func:`re.sub`."
msgstr "替换字符串或可调用对象。可调用对象接收正则匹配对象并必须返回要使用的替换字符串。如果`pat`是字典，则必须为None值，请参见:func:`re.sub`。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:15
msgid "Number of replacements to make from start."
msgstr "从开始处进行替换的次数。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:17
msgid ""
"Determines if replace is case sensitive:  - If True, case sensitive (the "
"default if `pat` is a string) - Set to False for case insensitive - "
"Cannot be set if `pat` is a compiled regex."
msgstr ""
"确定替换是否区分大小写： - 如果为 True，则区分大小写（如果 `pat` 是字符串"
"，则为默认值） - 设置为 False 表示不区分大小写 - 如果 `pat` 是已编译的"
"正则表达式，则无法设置。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:23
msgid ""
"Regex module flags, e.g. re.IGNORECASE. Cannot be set if `pat` is a "
"compiled regex."
msgstr ""
"正则表达式模块标志，例如 re.IGNORECASE。如果 `pat` 是已编译的正则表达式，"
"则无法设置。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:26
msgid ""
"Determines if the passed-in pattern is a regular expression:  - If True, "
"assumes the passed-in pattern is a regular expression. - If False, treats"
" the pattern as a literal string - Cannot be set to False if `pat` is a "
"compiled regex or `repl` is   a callable."
msgstr ""
"确定传入的模式是否为正则表达式： - 如果为 True，假定传入的模式是"
"正则表达式。 - 如果为 False，将模式视为字面字符串 - 如果 `pat` 是已编译的"
"正则表达式或 `repl` 是可调用对象，则无法设置为 False。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:34
msgid ""
"A copy of the object with all matching occurrences of `pat` replaced by "
"`repl`."
msgstr "一个副本，其中 `pat` 的所有匹配项都被 `repl` 替换。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:38
msgid ""
"* if `regex` is False and `repl` is a callable or `pat` is a compiled"
"       regex     * if `pat` is a compiled regex and `case` or `flags` is "
"set     * if `pat` is a dictionary and `repl` is not None."
msgstr "* 如果`regex`为False且`repl`是可调用对象或`pat`是已编译的正则表达式     * 如果`pat`是已编译的正则表达式且设置了`case`或`flags`     * 如果`pat`是字典且`repl`不为None。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:38
msgid ""
"if `regex` is False and `repl` is a callable or `pat` is a compiled"
"       regex     * if `pat` is a compiled regex and `case` or `flags` is "
"set     * if `pat` is a dictionary and `repl` is not None."
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:42
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.replace`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:43
msgid "Method to replace occurrences of a substring with another substring."
msgstr "将子字符串的出现替换为另一个子字符串的方法。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:45
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.extract`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:46
msgid "Extract substrings using a regular expression."
msgstr "使用正则表达式提取子字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:48
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.findall`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:49
msgid "Find all occurrences of a pattern or regex in each string."
msgstr "查找每个字符串中模式或正则表达式的所有出现。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:51
msgid ":py:obj:`LiteFrame.str.split`"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:52
msgid "Split each string by a specified delimiter or pattern."
msgstr "按指定分隔符或模式拆分每个字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:55
msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.replace:56
msgid ""
"When `pat` is a compiled regex, all flags should be included in the "
"compiled regex. Use of `case`, `flags`, or `regex=False` with a compiled "
"regex will raise an error."
msgstr ""
"当 `pat` 是已编译的正则表达式时，所有标志都应包含在已编译的正则表达式中。"
"使用 `case`、`flags` 或 `regex=False` 与已编译的正则表达式一起使用会引发"
"错误。"

